  "stem": "If \\(x(x + 4) = 21\\) and \\(x > 0\\), what is the value of \\(x\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "3"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Expand and rearrange: \\(x^{2} + 4x - 21 = 0\\).",
    "Factor: \\((x + 7)(x - 3) = 0\\), so \\(x = -7\\) or \\(x = 3\\). Since \\(x > 0\\), \\(x = 3\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
